OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's #70m surgical hub
OL,4,Areaches key milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #70m diagnostic and surgical hub
OL,7,Fhas reached an "important milestone" as
OL,8,Fplanning permission is granted.
OL,10,FSalisbury District Hospital's leaders
OL,11,Fsaid they hope the new hub, which will
OL,12,Finclude five surgical theatres, an MRI
OL,13,Fscanner and a CT scanner, will reduce
OL,14,Fdelays and improve patient experience.
OL,16,FWiltshire Council granted planning
OL,17,Fpermission for the project on Thursday,
OL,18,Fwhich hospital chiefs described as an
OL,19,F"important milestone".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
